@baseUrl = http://localhost:5177
@medicalToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_MEDICAL_JWT
@parentToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_VERIFIED_PARENT_JWT
@caseId = REPLACE_WITH_CASE_GUID
@guardianId = REPLACE_WITH_GUARDIAN_GUID

### 需先由 16 套用 migration；token 與邀請碼只在本機填寫，不提交真實資料到 Git。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"childName":"測試幼兒","birthDate":"2022-01-01","sex":"UNKNOWN","nationalId":"A123456789","address":"測試地址"}

### 醫療讀取個案
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}

### 醫療個案列表（本院所、分頁）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}

### 修改核心資料；revision 必須使用上一次 GET 的結果
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"childName":"修改測試幼兒","birthDate":"2022-01-01","sex":"UNKNOWN","nationalId":"A123456789","address":"修改測試地址","revision":0}

### 新增照顧者
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}/guardians
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"測試照顧者","phone":"0900000000","email":"guardian@example.invalid","relationship":"GUARDIAN","isPrimaryContact":true}

### 本院所既有照顧者；已有相同手機時先選擇既有聯絡資料
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/guardians?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}

### 連結既有照顧者；其他照顧者使用 false，不自動完成家長綁定
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}/guardians/{{guardianId}}/link
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"relationship":"FATHER","isPrimaryContact":false}

### 個案照顧者清單
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}/guardians
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}

### 產生邀請（原碼只回傳一次）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}/guardians/{{guardianId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalToken}}

### 家長綁定（必須已由後端驗證手機）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"invitationCode":"REPLACE_WITH_ONE_TIME_CODE"}

### 我的孩子
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### 教師完成狀態，不包含答案
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/cases/{{caseId}}/teacher-completion
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
